This is Paradox Travel Network's marketing/booking-advisor website: a static React + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind site (Framer Motion animation, a pure-three.js interactive globe). There is no backend, no database, and no auth -- do not add Supabase, a database module, or an auth hook unless explicitly asked. Forms: general contact is a mailto: link (no form), trip-planning links out to a Tern-hosted intake form, and the newsletter signup posts directly to MailerLite\'s public subscribe API from NewsletterForm.tsx. Google Analytics (gtag) is wired into index.html.

GitHub (https://github.com/brianv1976/paradox-travel-network, main branch) is the single source of truth. Never push or commit anything to that GitHub repo on your own -- only pull from it and reset local files to match. If something here needs to go to GitHub, ask Brian first.
